en-US.description:
Zesty Saloon Wins the 2026 Korean Burger Championship!!! This isn't the end; as a representative powerhouse of Korean burgers, they are heading to the World Burger Championship held in the U.S. Please cheer them on so they can go from a famous burger spot in Seongsu to a world-class burger restaurant ♥️♥️

As judge Chef Won-il Lee (@wonillee) mentioned, the Korea Burger Championship, which took place over several months, was a competition that symbolically demonstrated just how much the Korean burger scene has grown. Go Korea, Go K-Burger!!!!! 🍔🍔🍔

📌1st Place: Zesty Saloon, Seongsu, Seoul @zestysaloon

📌2nd Place: Le Freak, Seongsu, Seoul @le_freak_burger

📌3rd Place: Jeju Mooger Burger @mooger__burger

