Oakberry in Myeongdong, the first stop for foreigners visiting Korea

Myeongdong is where you can experience all of Korean culture—K-beauty, K-fashion, and K-food! Oakberry, the world's No. 1 acai berry brand, has finally opened its doors! 🫐🫶

I was so happy to see it after attending mass at Myeongdong Cathedral over the weekend, and it was delicious! It's right in front of Olive Young, so it's perfect for shopping and relaxing!

